#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk perangkat klaster tersebut."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Nama: klaster lain sudah menggunakan nama ini."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Klaster tidak disimpan: telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak formulir dibuka, atau penulisan gagal. Buka kembali dan ulangi perubahan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Klaster telah disimpan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Status klaster tidak diubah: penulisan gagal. Lihat log Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Klaster beserta snapshot temboloknya telah dihapus. Perangkat dan grafiknya tetap dipertahankan. Penjadwal tidak dihubungi."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Perangkat dan grafiknya telah dibuat."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Perangkat tidak dibuat: klaster sudah memiliki perangkat, telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak halaman dibuka, atau Cacti menolaknya. Lihat log Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Klaster telah dipetakan ke perangkat."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Klaster tidak dipetakan: perangkat tidak ada, tidak diizinkan untuk Anda, sudah menampung klaster lain, atau klaster telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak halaman dibuka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Grafik yang hilang telah ditambahkan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Tidak ada grafik yang ditambahkan: klaster tidak memiliki perangkat, atau perangkatnya sudah tidak ada."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Pemetaan klaster tidak dilepas: telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak halaman dibuka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Pemetaan klaster telah dilepas. Perangkat dan grafiknya tetap dipertahankan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Partisi telah diindeks ulang dari snapshot."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks ulang: perangkat dinonaktifkan atau mati, sehingga Cacti melewati kueri datanya."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks ulang: Cacti tidak dapat menjalankan kueri data. Lihat log Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks ulang: kueri data HPC Scheduler belum diinstal. Instal templat dari halaman kesehatan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks ulang: klaster tidak memiliki perangkat, atau perangkatnya sudah tidak ada."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Templat HPC Scheduler telah terinstal."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Templat tidak diinstal: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Tampilan pemantauan"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Observasi tidak dapat dibaca. Minta administrator untuk memeriksa log plugin."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Periksa kelompok alasan tertunda dan kebaruan snapshot pada ringkasan. Eskalasikan kredensial, pemetaan klaster, dan kebijakan pemeliharaan kepada administrator."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Nama: gunakan 1 hingga 64 huruf, angka, titik, tanda hubung, atau garis bawah, dimulai dengan huruf atau angka."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: pilih salah satu poller yang tercantum."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Interval Pengumpulan: masukkan detik bulat dari %d hingga %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Transpor: pilih salah satu transpor yang tercantum."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: masukkan jalur absolut, atau biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan bawaan poller."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "URL slurmrestd: host dan port ini tidak ada dalam daftar host slurmrestd di Pengaturan."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "URL slurmrestd: masukkan URL https:// tanpa nama pengguna, kueri, atau fragmen; http:// biasa hanya diterima untuk alamat loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Pengguna slurmrestd: gunakan maksimal 64 huruf, angka, titik, tanda hubung, atau garis bawah, atau biarkan kosong untuk token pengguna."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "File Token: masukkan jalur absolut file token pada poller. Token itu sendiri tidak pernah dimasukkan di sini."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "File Token: belum ada direktori file token yang ditetapkan. Minta administrator Cacti untuk menetapkannya di bawah Pengaturan, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "File Token: file harus berada di dalam salah satu direktori file token yang ditetapkan di Pengaturan (%s)."

